title: Renaissance Step 0 — fixed serve (build hole + boot crash) by deleting canvas
summary: First build round of the Paradigm Suite renaissance. Wired the orphaned build:platform-ui into the main build chain (serve was shipping a 2-month-stale dist), added port auto-increment, and discovered serve also crashed on boot from canvas's Express-4 `/files/*` wildcard routes (invalid under Express 5). Since canvas was already team-decided for deletion (TD-2026-06-14-853), brought that cut forward — deleting it fixed the boot crash. serve now boots clean (canvas absent from sections), 441/441 tests pass.
